{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pulls/416","id":4467514004,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSpI5QM8AAAABCkjalA","html_url":"https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pull/416","diff_url":"https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pull/416.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pull/416.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/issues/416","number":416,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add Astrofolio verification with source-backed claims and failure-safe checks","user":{"login":"zodiacs-org","id":289121529,"node_id":"U_kgDOETuk-Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/289121529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org","html_url":"https://github.com/zodiacs-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zodiacs-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This adds `/registry/verify/`, a single Astrofolio verification page where a visitor can find all 24 chain-specific identifiers, check one against the published Registry, and inspect dated claims and their limitations. It stays noindex during review and uses the existing site shell, artwork, Registry, disclosures, origin receipts and address parser.\n\nThe browser checks fresh same-origin Registry bytes against the reviewed SHA-256. Malformed input, wrong or unsupported network, an unknown identifier, changed source bytes and unavailable sources have distinct outcomes; failure or editing the input clears an earlier match. Pasted identifiers stay out of requests, URLs and persistent storage. Solana comparison is case-sensitive; Base comparison explicitly checks hexadecimal-byte membership without asserting mixed-case checksum validation or SDK parity.\n\nThe static page and embedded machine facts come from one local evidence adapter. Ten qualified claims distinguish public records, operator attestations, unresolved rights, contradictory sources and the platform candidate. Rebuilding never refreshes an observation date. A match establishes Registry membership, with visible limits on safety, endorsement and holder-rights implications.\n\n### Review and evidence\n\n- [Application preview](https://zodiacs-lkqoi56y1-zodiacsofficial.vercel.app/registry/verify/): Vercel READY at `4704acc5c7a0625dedd7601009b9c17207892ba9`, protected by Vercel login. The final anonymous browser reached that login; protected remote product scenarios remain unverified. The later delivery commit adds only documentation, test harness options and evidence.\n- Node 22.23.2: full build and repository check passed (zero errors/warnings, eleven existing hints). **4,484 tests in 406 files passed**, including 75 new scoped tests. Three unrelated five-second timeouts in the first concurrent run are preserved; the final two-worker run passed without weakening timeouts.\n- **11/11 local Chromium scenarios passed**: desktop/mobile320/390, contrast, keyboard/copy, no-JS facts, network/storage privacy, source tampering/failure, cancellation and real service-worker offline behavior. Six pre-existing shared shell assets miss offline; exact diagnostics remain in the evidence.\n- Twenty source-grounded answer fixtures: identifiers correct and no invented rights/endorsements. **14/20 met all reviewed requirements**; five citation gaps and two omitted qualifications (overlapping counts) are preserved. Checker-source links were added; answers were not rerun. This does not establish organic discovery or independent certification.\n\n[Checkpoint, exact commands, SHAs, logs and captures](https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/blob/codex/astrofolio-verification/docs/astrofolio-trust/STATUS.md) · [Desktop capture](https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/blob/codex/astrofolio-verification/docs/astrofolio-trust/evidence/verification-1280-hero.png) · [Mobile capture](https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/blob/codex/astrofolio-verification/docs/astrofolio-trust/evidence/verification-390-hero.png) · [Material evidence gaps](https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/blob/codex/astrofolio-verification/docs/astrofolio-trust/EVIDENCE-GAPS.md)\n\n### Integration hold\n\nOnly `src/pages/registry/verify/**`, `src/registry/astrofolio-verification/**`, `tests/astrofolio-verification/**` and `docs/astrofolio-trust/**` are changed. Engine, SDK, API, developer-platform, canonical sources, package/configuration and shared site files stay outside this workstream. Refreshed platform PR #415 and #417 file lists have zero owned-file overlap; the SDK #6 hold is unchanged.\n\n**Build & Check CI currently fails at the existing Phase 1 scope guard for the one new Registry route.** The guard is unchanged. Two small, unapplied [integration patches](https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial/site/blob/codex/astrofolio-verification/docs/astrofolio-trust/integration/README.md) are reserved for the primary session: the exact-base route allowance and one contextual Registry link. Both pass `git apply --check`. The primary integrator must reconcile the allowance with the actual integration base, apply accepted shared changes, regenerate the Registry hub when adding its link, and rerun CI.\n\nIndependent entity/rights provenance, applicable holder grants and the scope of economic interests/control remain unresolved; the page says so. Keep this draft and its noindex policy until integration review. No production merge, deployment or package publication was performed.\n","created_at":"2026-09-07T20:23:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-07T20:49:59Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9c2a4ba0ccdbdc5d0477e052817993e0cfdba344","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pulls/416/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pulls/416/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/issues/416/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZodiacsOfficial/site/statuses/b17d6804960b6b30bb48208aff0f783b03768152","head":{"label":"ZodiacsOfficial:codex/astrofolio-verification","ref":"codex/astrofolio-verification","sha":"b17d6804960b6b30bb48208aff0f783b03768152","user":{"login":"ZodiacsOfficial","id":289132375,"node_id":"O_kgDOETvPVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/289132375?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZodiacsOfficial","html_url":"https://github.com/ZodiacsOfficial","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZodiacsOfficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZodiacsOfficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZodiacsOfficial/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZodiacsOfficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZodiacsOfficial/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZodiacsOfficial/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZodiacsOfficial/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZodiacsOfficial/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZodiacsOfficial/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"